+
+The generated target is byte-for-byte the producer-expected conjunction:
+
+- declaration: `Klean95CheckDictCase.Lemmas.targetStatement`
+- definition SHA-256:
+  `d09d5b0be50ff5667570dd7a99f5d11e8e0638300ca0b6ac88bb1499108646b0`
+- statement SHA-256:
